{
  "summary": "Newsletters are regular publications with multiple columns that make reading and navigating articles easier. To create a newsletter in LibreOffice Writer, start a new text document and save it. Navigate to Format on the menu bar and select Columns to configure the desired number of columns, their width, spacing, and separator lines. Setting the columns field value to 2 creates two columns in the text area. Text entered fills the first column before automatically moving to the next column. Alternatively, to jump directly to the next column, click Insert, choose Manual Break, select Column break, and click OK. Images can also be inserted and resized to fit within columns. Writer supports various formatting options, including text alignment, highlighting, and setting text background colors. Additionally, banners or advertisements can be created by selecting the Text option from the Drawing toolbar to place a text box. Users can then apply animation effects, such as Blink, to make the text flash.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "A newsletter is a publication distributed to subscribers at regular intervals, containing multiple columns to facilitate reading articles.",
      "evidence": "सूचनापत्र एक प्रकाशन की तरह उपयोगित है जिसे उनके ग्राहकों को समय के नियमित interval पर प्रचारित किया जाता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A new text document can be opened by clicking File, New, and then Text Document.",
      "evidence": "file new और text document option पर क्लिक करके एक नया text document खोलते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Columns are added to a document by clicking Format on the menu bar and selecting Columns.",
      "evidence": "पहले menu bar में format button पर click करें और फिर columns पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The columns dialog box allows setting the number, width, spacing, and separator line properties of the columns.",
      "evidence": "इन columns की width and spacing निर्धारित करते हैं साथ ही separator line विभाजक रेखा की विभिन्न विशेषतायें निर्धारित करते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Setting the value of the columns field to 2 creates two columns in the text area.",
      "evidence": "हम columns field की value 2 बढ़ाकर सूचनापत्र document के लिए दो columns चुनेंगे"
    },
    {
      "fact": "When typing reaches the end of the first column, the cursor automatically advances to the next column.",
      "evidence": "पहले column के अंत पर पहुँचने के बाद cursor स्वतः ही अगले column में चला जाता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Pictures can be inserted and resized to properly fit inside a column.",
      "evidence": "आप इस column में picture भी प्रविष्ट कर सकते हैं और उसका साइज फिर से बदल सकते हैं जिससे कि वह column में सही बैठ जाए"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A manual column break is inserted by clicking Insert, selecting Manual Break, choosing Column break, and clicking OK.",
      "evidence": "insert button पर click करें और फिर manual break पर click करें dialog box जो दिखता है उसमें column break button पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Selecting Green 4 from the background color icon changes the background of selected text to light green.",
      "evidence": "toolbar में background color icon पर click करें और फिर green 4 click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Banners can be added to the document by selecting the Text option from the Drawing toolbar and placing a text box.",
      "evidence": "drawing toolbar में text option पर पहला क्लिक करके सूचनापत्र में banners भी जोड़ सकते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Text animation options can be accessed by right-clicking the text and selecting Text from the context menu.",
      "evidence": "पहले text पर दायाँ click करें और फिर menu में text option पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Selecting the Blink effect from the Text Animation tab causes the text to flash.",
      "evidence": "सूचनापत्र में text को जगमगाने के लिए हम blink option पर click करते हैं"
    }
  ]
}
